{
  "notes": [
    "robot-coder in steel with blue trim: the same robot, part for part, in another color.",
    "Sockets: grip in the near hand (out of the drum when its arms are). A scene swaps what it holds per item (holds), e.g. { \"grip\": \"held-magnifier\" }.",
    "States: every state a person has: idle, face-right, face-away-left and face-away-right; walk, sit (on a chair on the same tile, turned as it is) and type (sitting at the desk in front), each with -right, -away-left and -away-right; look, laugh, jump (once), dance, wave, write, angry (then fuming: steam), weld, operate and point. A robot's own: think (a hand to its chin, its light blinking), talk and sleep (its light pulsing as it charges). Without a heading of their own, states play at the heading the scene gives the item."
  ],
  "category": [
    "Agents",
    "Robots"
  ],
  "kind": "sprite",
